{"id":"tuch","lemma":"Tuch","pos":"noun","rank":4314,"glosses":["cloth; piece of fabric or tissue of any kind: scarf, kerchief, blanket, towel, etc."],"ipa":"/tuːx/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7d/De-Tuch.ogg/De-Tuch.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Tuches","plural":"Tücher"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich brauche jetzt ein Tuch.","en":"I need a tissue now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745833","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ich wickelte mich in ein Tuch ein.","en":"I wrapped myself in a towel.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to wrap","l":"wickeln"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"a"}]},{"text":"Die Polizei bedeckte die Leiche mit einem Tuch.","en":"The police covered the body with a sheet.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"police"},{"g":"covered","l":"bedeckt"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"dead body"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Das Tuch ist ungewöhnlich saugfähig.","en":"This cloth is unusually absorbent.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"unusually"},null]},{"text":"Bedecke den Topf mit einem Tuch!","en":"Cover the saucepan with a tea towel.","words":[{"g":"to cover","l":"bedecken"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"pot, jar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},null]}]}